  "text_md": "<!-- image -->\n\n## Campus Map (coming soon)\n\n## Prayer Rooms\n\nThere will be two prayer rooms available for anyone wishing to observe religious practice onsite during event hours. Prayer rooms are located on the 2nd level of the Marriott Marquis Houston in Montgomery rooms A&amp;B. The Marriott Marquis Houston is attached to the George R. Brown Convention Center and can be accessed from the level 2 skybridge located north of Mezzanine A.\n\n## Registration and Badging\n\nPlease be ready to present you ID when picking up your badge. [Badges can be printed / reprinted with preferred name ]\n\n## Check-In\n\nWe strongly encourage your team to complete attendee badging prior to your arrival; as this will expedite your team's attendee badge collection and your entrance to the event.\n\nFIRST requires every Championship attendee to be registered and badged; including adult team mentors, youth team members, parents; family members; chaperones; etc. who are participating in the event. Attendee registration grants access to participant-only activities and increases the security of the event.\n\n## Consent and Release Forms\n\nAll participating team members and volunteers must complete a current season FIRST Consent and Release form.\n\n## Pronoun Ribbons\n\nAvailable at Central Registration and program Pit Admins.\n\n## Registration and Badging Hours\n\nCentral Registration Hours:\n\n| Date:                   | Open:   | Close   |\n|-------------------------|---------|---------|\n|                         | 7.00 AM | 6:00 PM |\n|                         | 6.00 AM | 8:00 PM |\n| Thursday_April 18,2024  | 7.00 AM | 6:00 PM |\n| Friday April 19,2024    | 7.00 AM | 6:00 PM |\n| Saturday April 20, 2024 | 7.00 AM | 2:00 PM |\n\n## Satellite Registration Hours:\n\n| Date:                     | Satellite Area:            | Open:    | Close:   |\n|---------------------------|----------------------------|----------|----------|\n| Tuesday_April 19,2024     | FIRST Tech Challenge       | 3.00 PM  | 6.30 PM  |\n| Wednesday_ April 20, 2024 | FIRST Tech Challenge       | 7.00 AM  | Noon     |\n|                           |                            | 7.00 AM  | 7.30 PM  |\n| Wednesday April 20, 2023  | FIRSTLEGO League_Challenge | 11.00 AM | 3.00 PM  |\n\n## FIRSTCHAMPIONSHIP-ORG",
